cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Se este software for usado numa publicação, cite-o como abaixo."
type: software
title: "dsgelab: a general toolkit for solving DSGE models in Python"
abstract: >-
  Steady state, Klein/QZ first-order solution, second- and third-order perturbation, nonlinear perfect-foresight transitions, calibration on targets, and export to Dynare and MacroModelling.jl. Validated against Dynare and MacroModelling.jl.
authors:
